{"id":"5a8eacbae17c9e40","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-df-prism.md","title":"Prismatic Ideal","display":"df-prism — Prismatic Ideal","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-prism","aliases":["58-df-prism"],"display":"df-prism — Prismatic Ideal","depends_on":["[[../batch05/58-df-ideal.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-prism"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-prism</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-prism — Prismatic Ideal"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6e4f95381faac4f9\" href=\"?note=6e4f95381faac4f9\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-ideal.md\">../batch05/58-df-ideal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\\in V\">\\(\\kappa\\in V\\)</span> (cardinal parameter, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\kappa)\">\\(I\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\kappa)\\)</span> (ideal, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"6e4f95381faac4f9\" href=\"?note=6e4f95381faac4f9\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-ideal.md\">../batch05/58-df-ideal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\)</span> (cardinal predicate, from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ideal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ideal}\\)</span> (ideal predicate, from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"6e4f95381faac4f9\" href=\"?note=6e4f95381faac4f9\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-ideal.md\">../batch05/58-df-ideal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j:V\\to M\">\\(j:V\\to M\\)</span> (初等嵌入)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{crit}(j)\">\\(\\operatorname{crit}(j)\\)</span> (临界点)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{KCompleteIdeal}_\\kappa\">\\(\\operatorname{KCompleteIdeal}_\\kappa\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>-完全理想谓词)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prismatic}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Prismatic}_S\\)</span> (prismatic ideal predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}prism}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Prismatic}_S(I,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Ideal}(I,\\mathcal P(\\kappa))\n\\land\\forall\\mathcal A\\subseteq I\\;(|\\mathcal A|&lt;\\kappa\\to\\bigcup\\mathcal A\\in I)\n\\land\\forall j,M\\;((j:V\\to M\\land\\operatorname{crit}(j)=\\kappa)\n\\to j(I)\\cap V\\subseteq I)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}prism}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Prismatic}_S(I,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Ideal}(I,\\mathcal P(\\kappa))\n\\land\\forall\\mathcal A\\subseteq I\\;(|\\mathcal A|&lt;\\kappa\\to\\bigcup\\mathcal A\\in I)\n\\land\\forall j,M\\;((j:V\\to M\\land\\operatorname{crit}(j)=\\kappa)\n\\to j(I)\\cap V\\subseteq I)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>“Prismatic” 在本知识库中作为上述嵌入不变的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>-完全理想性质使用；公式给出其全部局部含义，不把名称当作未定义原语。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch05/58-df-ideal.md","status":"resolved","id":"6e4f95381faac4f9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-ideal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\kappa\\in V$ (cardinal parameter, see [[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-ideal.md","status":"resolved","id":"6e4f95381faac4f9","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$I\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\kappa)$ (ideal, see [[../batch05/58-df-ideal.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S$ (cardinal predicate, from [[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-ideal.md","status":"resolved","id":"6e4f95381faac4f9","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ideal}$ (ideal predicate, from [[../batch05/58-df-ideal.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\kappa\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"I\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\kappa)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S","di